WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sometimes big things that happen in life make our body feel tired like we have butterflies in our stomach.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
This exercise can help your body feel more normal if you feel like that.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
It might feel a little funny at first, but with practice you get better and no one will even notice you're doing it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
For PMR we are tricking your muscles.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
First, we make them very tight like when you feel stressed.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Then we make them very relaxed.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Start by sitting comfortably in your chair.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Put both feet on the floor and let your arms hang down.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
You can close your eyes if it helps you relax.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Try to notice how your whole body feels right now.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Now, while sitting, pretend you will get a million dollars if you push hard with your legs.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Hold the push for 10 seconds.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Ready, set, go.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:55.000
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Now, relax your legs.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Let's try it again.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
This time push with your legs and make your hands go into fists and squeeze them tight at the same time.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Ready.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Remember, one million dollars.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Go.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:19.000
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.000
You did great.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Shake your legs and wiggle your fingers.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.000
PMR is something you can do for any part of your body that feels tight.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Your counselor can help you learn how to do it.

